  },
  {
   "start": 42.12,
   "end": 49.1,
   "text": "Word mean, you know have cave money now so you promise give cave money every full moon for next.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.186,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.05
  },
  {
   "start": 49.74,
   "end": 56.78,
   "text": "Five hundred full moon. But me confused. Me ask, why give cave money later for cave now? Cave seller",
   "avg_logprob": -0.186,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.05
  },
  {
   "start": 56.78,
   "end": 64.6,
   "text": "do real scary long laugh and disappear in smoke cloud. When smoke go, me see new cave with sign",
   "avg_logprob": -0.128,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.025
  },
  {
   "start": 64.6,
   "end": 72.6,
   "text": "on top. It say, bank. Me go in. They say, we give you one million cave money now but you give back",
   "avg_logprob": -0.128,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.025
  },
  {
   "start": 72.6,
   "end": 81.78,
   "text": "two million cave money over many moon. Me say, well two only bid bigger than one so seem pretty",
   "avg_logprob": -0.128,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.025
  },
  {
   "start": 81.78,
   "end": 91.56,
   "text": "good deal. Wait bank say, it called interest. It like thank you gift to us for letting you",
   "avg_logprob": -0.198,
